2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=77902153-4-61460&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-865e00cfe7140022f4b22e9199415781&mrid=53cf46849ed65c0d9a74bed32e201717 MyHe
2 CONC ritage Family Trees] via wife [http://www.geni.com/profile-34667032880 Eleonora 7. Principe Di Francavilla (born Borghese)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 28 2014, 23:03:32 UTC''
