2 CONT      Eleonora Brancaccio was born in 1875 at Rome, Italy. She married Camillo Francesco Massimo, Prince di Arsoli, son of Don Carlo Alberto Massimo, 3rd Principe di Arsoli and Donna Francesca di Paola Lucchesi-Palli, in 1895 at Ro
2 CONC me, Italy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1943.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Massimo.
